IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ta-nouns`
IMPORT `ta-logic`
IMPORT `ta-voluntary-disclosure`

-- Tests of ss 21CA to 21CF.  Expected values are written from the text (the quoted words beside each).
-- Calendar used below (2026): Mon 2 Nov; Sun 15 Nov; Sun 29 Nov; Mon 30 Nov; Tue 1 Dec; Thu 31 Dec.

§§ `s 21CA tests`
-- Condition 1 facts columns: A carries on a business in the regulated sector as a relevant undertaking, the information came to A in the course of it, each recipient is also such an undertaking
`condition 1 met` MEANS `Condition 1 facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`condition 1, A is not a relevant undertaking` MEANS `Condition 1 facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE
`condition 1, information came from elsewhere` MEANS `Condition 1 facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`condition 1, a recipient is not a relevant undertaking` MEANS `Condition 1 facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(2) condition 1 is met` `condition 1 met` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(2) condition 1 is met` `condition 1, A is not a relevant undertaking` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(2) condition 1 is met` `condition 1, information came from elsewhere` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(2) condition 1 is met` `condition 1, a recipient is not a relevant undertaking` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Request facts columns: a constable has requested, the recipient (or one of them) has requested
`requested by a constable` MEANS `Request facts` OF TRUE, FALSE
`requested by a recipient` MEANS `Request facts` OF FALSE, TRUE
`requested by both` MEANS `Request facts` OF TRUE, TRUE
`requested by nobody` MEANS `Request facts` OF FALSE, FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(3) condition 2 is met` `requested by a constable` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(3) condition 2 is met` `requested by a recipient` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(3) condition 2 is met` `requested by both` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(3) condition 2 is met` `requested by nobody` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(4) condition 3 is met` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(4) condition 3 is met` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Assist facts columns: satisfied it may assist a suspicion matter, satisfied it may assist an identification matter
`assists a suspicion` MEANS `Assist facts` OF TRUE, FALSE
`assists an identification` MEANS `Assist facts` OF FALSE, TRUE
`assists neither` MEANS `Assist facts` OF FALSE, FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(5) condition 4 is met` `assists a suspicion` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(5) condition 4 is met` `assists an identification` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(5) condition 4 is met` `assists neither` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(6) condition 5 is met` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(6) condition 5 is met` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(7) condition 5 does not apply` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(7) condition 5 does not apply` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 21CA(1): conditions 1 to 4, and condition 5 where applicable (reading F8)
#ASSERT `s 21CA(1) A may disclose information to one or more other persons` `condition 1 met` `requested by a constable` TRUE `assists a suspicion` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(1) A may disclose information to one or more other persons` `condition 1 met` `requested by a recipient` TRUE `assists a suspicion` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a recipient's request without condition 5 fails the permission; the text does not forbid the disclosure
-- rulings of 2026-11-05: s 21CA(1) "may disclose ... if" conditions 1 to 4 (and 5 where applicable): a condition not met is JUST FALSE, not NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CA(1) A may disclose information to one or more other persons` `condition 1 met` `requested by a recipient` TRUE `assists a suspicion` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(1) A may disclose information to one or more other persons` `condition 1, A is not a relevant undertaking` `requested by a constable` TRUE `assists a suspicion` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(1) A may disclose information to one or more other persons` `condition 1 met` `requested by nobody` TRUE `assists a suspicion` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(1) A may disclose information to one or more other persons` `condition 1 met` `requested by a constable` FALSE `assists a suspicion` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(1) A may disclose information to one or more other persons` `condition 1 met` `requested by a constable` TRUE `assists neither` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(8) the person may disclose information to A for the purposes of making a disclosure request` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CA(8) the person may disclose information to A for the purposes of making a disclosure request` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 21CB tests`
-- Request content facts columns: states the connection, identifies the person or property so far as known, describes the information, specifies the recipients
#ASSERT `s 21CB(1) the disclosure request has the content the section requires` (`Request content facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(1) the disclosure request has the content the section requires` (`Request content facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(1) the disclosure request has the content the section requires` (`Request content facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(1) the disclosure request has the content the section requires` (`Request content facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(1) the disclosure request has the content the section requires` (`Request content facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Recipient request facts columns: made by a person in s 21CA(3)(b), states a suspicion connection, states an identification connection, sets out the grounds, provides other information
`by a recipient, suspicion, grounds` MEANS `Recipient request facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`by a recipient, suspicion, other information` MEANS `Recipient request facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`by a recipient, suspicion, neither` MEANS `Recipient request facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`by a recipient, identification, other information` MEANS `Recipient request facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`by a recipient, identification, grounds only` MEANS `Recipient request facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
`by a constable, suspicion` MEANS `Recipient request facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(2) subsections (3) and (4) apply to the request` `by a recipient, suspicion, grounds` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(2) subsections (3) and (4) apply to the request` `by a constable, suspicion` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(3) the request states the grounds or other information` `by a recipient, suspicion, grounds` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(3) the request states the grounds or other information` `by a recipient, suspicion, other information` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(3) the request states the grounds or other information` `by a recipient, suspicion, neither` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 21CB(3) and (4) "If the request states ...": the "if" is not met, JUST FALSE (ruling of 2026-11-05)
#ASSERT `s 21CB(3) the request states the grounds or other information` `by a recipient, identification, other information` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(4) the request provides the other information` `by a recipient, identification, other information` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- for an identification request the grounds alone are not "such other information"
#ASSERT `s 21CB(4) the request provides the other information` `by a recipient, identification, grounds only` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(4) the request provides the other information` `by a recipient, suspicion, grounds` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(5) the required notification is made by the person the subsection names` `a constable` `Person A` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(5) the required notification is made by the person the subsection names` `a constable` `Person B` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(5) the required notification is made by the person the subsection names` `a person mentioned in s 21CA(3)(b)` `Person B` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(5) the required notification is made by the person the subsection names` `a person mentioned in s 21CA(3)(b)` `Person A` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(6) the notification has the content the subsection requires` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(6) the notification has the content the subsection requires` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Requester notification facts columns: states a request has been made, specifies the person asked, suspicion request, suspect known, identifies suspect, property request, holder known, identifies property and holder
#ASSERT `s 21CB(7) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Requester notification facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the suspect is not known: nothing to identify ("so far as known")
#ASSERT `s 21CB(7) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Requester notification facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the suspect is known but not identified
#ASSERT `s 21CB(7) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Requester notification facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a property request: the property and holder identified if known
#ASSERT `s 21CB(7) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Requester notification facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(7) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Requester notification facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(7) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Requester notification facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(7) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Requester notification facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Advance notification facts columns: states a request is to be made, specifies the person, describes the information, explains why
#ASSERT `s 21CB(8) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Advance notification facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(8) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Advance notification facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(8) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Advance notification facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(8) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Advance notification facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CB(8) the notification has the content the subsection requires` (`Advance notification facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 21CC tests`
-- Section 21CC applies facts columns: a question arises in proceedings, about A, about B, about C
#ASSERT `s 21CC(1) section 21CC applies` (`Section 21CC applies facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(1) section 21CC applies` (`Section 21CC applies facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(1) section 21CC applies` (`Section 21CC applies facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(1) section 21CC applies` (`Section 21CC applies facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(1) section 21CC applies` (`Section 21CC applies facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(2) the required notification satisfies the requirement to make the required disclosure` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(2) the required notification satisfies the requirement to make the required disclosure` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CC(2) the required notification satisfies the requirement to make the required disclosure` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CC(3) the joint disclosure report satisfies the requirement to make the required disclosure` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(3) the joint disclosure report satisfies the requirement to make the required disclosure` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 21CC(4): all four limbs; the content and timing limbs may themselves be not covered
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4) the report is a joint disclosure report` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4) the report is a joint disclosure report` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4) the report is a joint disclosure report` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4) the report is a joint disclosure report` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4) the report is a joint disclosure report` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4) the report is a joint disclosure report` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4) the report is a joint disclosure report` TRUE NOTHING TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- a limb that is plainly not met wins over a limb the text leaves open
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4) the report is a joint disclosure report` FALSE NOTHING TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Suspicion report content facts columns: explains the continuing grounds, the person is known, identifies the person, sets out the grounds, other relevant information
#ASSERT `s 21CC(5) the report has the content required for a suspicion` (`Suspicion report content facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(5) the report has the content required for a suspicion` (`Suspicion report content facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(5) the report has the content required for a suspicion` (`Suspicion report content facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(5) the report has the content required for a suspicion` (`Suspicion report content facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(5) the report has the content required for a suspicion` (`Suspicion report content facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(5) the report has the content required for a suspicion` (`Suspicion report content facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Property report content facts columns: explains the continuing grounds, property and holder known, identifies them, movement or use known, provides details, other relevant information
#ASSERT `s 21CC(6) the report has the content required for terrorist property` (`Property report content facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(6) the report has the content required for terrorist property` (`Property report content facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(6) the report has the content required for terrorist property` (`Property report content facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(6) the report has the content required for terrorist property` (`Property report content facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(6) the report has the content required for terrorist property` (`Property report content facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(6) the report has the content required for terrorist property` (`Property report content facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The applicable period.  A request by a person in s 21CA(3)(b): 28 days beginning with the day of the notification; Mon 2 Nov + 27 = Sun 29 Nov
#ASSERT `s 21CC(8) the length in days of the period of 28 days` NOTHING EQUALS 28
#ASSERT `s 21CC(8) the length in days of the period of 28 days` (JUST 14) EQUALS 14
-- s 21CC(8) notice columns: given by a constable, in writing, given to the person who made the required notification
#ASSERT `s 21CC(8) the notice varies the period of 28 days` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the grant is of a written notice: an oral notice, a notice by someone else or one given to someone else is outside it (scope limit with no "only": NOTHING, ruling of 2026-11-05 (c))
#ASSERT `s 21CC(8) the notice varies the period of 28 days` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CC(8) the notice varies the period of 28 days` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CC(8) the notice varies the period of 28 days` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CC(7) the last day of the applicable period` `a person mentioned in s 21CA(3)(b)` (Date 2 11 2026) 28 NOTHING EQUALS JUST (Date 29 11 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 21CC(7) the last day of the applicable period` `a person mentioned in s 21CA(3)(b)` (Date 2 11 2026) 28 NOTHING EQUALS JUST (Date 30 11 2026))
-- shortened to 14 days: Mon 2 Nov + 13 = Sun 15 Nov;  lengthened to 60 days: Mon 2 Nov + 59 = Thu 31 Dec
#ASSERT `s 21CC(7) the last day of the applicable period` `a person mentioned in s 21CA(3)(b)` (Date 2 11 2026) 14 NOTHING EQUALS JUST (Date 15 11 2026)
#ASSERT `s 21CC(7) the last day of the applicable period` `a person mentioned in s 21CA(3)(b)` (Date 2 11 2026) 60 NOTHING EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2026)
-- a request by a constable: the constable's own period, whatever it is
#ASSERT `s 21CC(7) the last day of the applicable period` `a constable` (Date 2 11 2026) 28 (JUST (Date 20 11 2026)) EQUALS JUST (Date 20 11 2026)
#ASSERT `s 21CC(7) the last day of the applicable period` `a constable` (Date 2 11 2026) 28 NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 21CC(4)(d) with the period ending Sun 29 Nov: sent on the last day is inside (reading F9); the day after is outside
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4)(d) the report is sent to the constable before the end of the applicable period` (Date 28 11 2026) (JUST (Date 29 11 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4)(d) the report is sent to the constable before the end of the applicable period` (Date 29 11 2026) (JUST (Date 29 11 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4)(d) the report is sent to the constable before the end of the applicable period` (Date 30 11 2026) (JUST (Date 29 11 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(4)(d) the report is sent to the constable before the end of the applicable period` (Date 30 11 2026) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- Report approval facts columns: there is a nominated officer of each person, approved by them, signed by them, approved and signed by another senior officer
#ASSERT `s 21CC(9) the joint disclosure report is approved and signed as required` (`Report approval facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(9) the joint disclosure report is approved and signed as required` (`Report approval facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(9) the joint disclosure report is approved and signed as required` (`Report approval facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- with a nominated officer, a senior officer's signature does not stand in
#ASSERT `s 21CC(9) the joint disclosure report is approved and signed as required` (`Report approval facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(9) the joint disclosure report is approved and signed as required` (`Report approval facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(9) the joint disclosure report is approved and signed as required` (`Report approval facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(10) the person counts as A, B or C` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(10) the person counts as A, B or C` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CC(10) the person counts as A, B or C` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 21CD tests`
#ASSERT `s 21CD(1) subsections (2) and (3) apply` `Person A` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(1) subsections (2) and (3) apply` `Person B` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(2) section 21CC(2) covers the matter, where A made the notification` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(2) section 21CC(2) covers the matter, where A made the notification` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 21CD(2), (5), (7), (8)(a), (10) "only so far as": outside what the subsection names, JUST FALSE (rulings of 2026-11-05)
#ASSERT `s 21CD(2) section 21CC(2) covers the matter, where A made the notification` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(3) section 21CC(2) removes the requirement for the matter, where A made the notification` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(3) section 21CC(2) removes the requirement for the matter, where A made the notification` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CD(4) subsections (5) to (8) apply` `Person B` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(4) subsections (5) to (8) apply` `Person A` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(5) section 21CC(2) covers the matter for A or C, where B made the notification` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(5) section 21CC(2) covers the matter for A or C, where B made the notification` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(5) section 21CC(2) covers the matter for A or C, where B made the notification` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(6) section 21CC(2) removes the requirement for the matter, where B made the notification` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(6) section 21CC(2) removes the requirement for the matter, where B made the notification` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CD(7) section 21CC(2) covers the matter for B` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(7) section 21CC(2) covers the matter for B` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(7) section 21CC(2) covers the matter for B` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(8)(a) section 21CC(2) covers the requirement` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(8)(a) section 21CC(2) covers the requirement` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(8)(a) section 21CC(2) covers the requirement` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(8)(b) section 21CC(2) removes the requirement` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(8)(b) section 21CC(2) removes the requirement` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CD(8)(b) section 21CC(2) removes the requirement` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CD(8)(b) section 21CC(2) removes the requirement` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CD(9) the person who made the required notification must notify a constable that a report is not being made` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(9) the person who made the required notification must notify a constable that a report is not being made` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#TRACE `s 21CD(9) the person who made the required notification must notify a constable` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the person who made the required notification` DOES `notify a constable that a joint disclosure report is not being made` AT 2
-- the trace above must end FULFILLED
#ASSERT `s 21CD(10) section 21CC(3) covers the matter` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(10) section 21CC(3) covers the matter` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(10) section 21CC(3) covers the matter` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(11) the term has the same meaning as in s 21CC` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CD(11) the term has the same meaning as in s 21CC` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 21CE tests`
#ASSERT `s 21CE(1) the relevant disclosure does not breach an obligation of confidence or any other restriction` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(1) the relevant disclosure does not breach an obligation of confidence or any other restriction` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CE(1) the relevant disclosure does not breach an obligation of confidence or any other restriction` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CE(2) the relevant disclosure is barred from including the information` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(2) the relevant disclosure is barred from including the information` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(2) the relevant disclosure is barred from including the information` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CE(2) the relevant disclosure is barred from including the information` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#TRACE `s 21CE(2) the person making the relevant disclosure shall not include information from a UK law enforcement agency` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the person in the regulated sector` DOES `include information obtained from a UK law enforcement agency` AT 2
-- the trace above must end in a BREACH by the person in the regulated sector
#TRACE `s 21CE(2) the person making the relevant disclosure shall not include information from a UK law enforcement agency` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a constable` DOES `disclose the matter to a constable` AT 2
-- the trace above must end FULFILLED once the clock passes with the prohibition respected, or stay pending: it is read by eye
-- s 21CE(3): a nominated officer acting for the undertaking
#ASSERT `s 21CE(3)(a) the disclosure by the undertaking is made as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(3)(a) the disclosure by the undertaking is made as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 21CE(3) "In a case where ...": the case is not met, JUST FALSE (ruling of 2026-11-05, (b))
#ASSERT `s 21CE(3)(a) the disclosure by the undertaking is made as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(3)(a) the disclosure by the undertaking is made as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(3)(b) the disclosure to the undertaking is made as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(3)(b) the disclosure to the undertaking is made as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(3)(b) the disclosure to the undertaking is made as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(3)(b) the disclosure to the undertaking is made as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(4) subsection (1) applies whether or not the conditions were met` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(4) subsection (1) applies whether or not the conditions were met` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(5) the disclosure is a relevant disclosure` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(5) the disclosure is a relevant disclosure` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(5) the disclosure is a relevant disclosure` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(5) the body is a UK law enforcement agency` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(5) the body is a UK law enforcement agency` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(5) the body is a UK law enforcement agency` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CE(5) the body is a UK law enforcement agency` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 21CF tests`
#ASSERT `s 21CF(2) the person is a constable for the purposes of ss 21CA to 21CE` (`Officer facts` OF TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CF(2) the person is a constable for the purposes of ss 21CA to 21CE` (`Officer facts` OF FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CF(2) the person is a constable for the purposes of ss 21CA to 21CE` (`Officer facts` OF FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CF(3) the business is a business in the regulated sector` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CF(3) the business is a business in the regulated sector` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 21CF(4) the request is a disclosure request` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CF(4) the request is a disclosure request` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CF(5) the person is a nominated officer` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CF(5) the person is a nominated officer` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 21CF(6) the person is a relevant undertaking` `a credit institution` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CF(6) the person is a relevant undertaking` `a financial institution` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 21CF(6) the person is a relevant undertaking` `a professional legal adviser` EQUALS JUST TRUE
